{"org":"elastic","repo":"elasticsearch","prNumber":"112963","commit":"d08ad4283e199fbe51c2d57804fd6a5657181c8d","generatedCommentsNodes":[{"comment":"The addition of `indexSettings().getSkipIgnoredSourceWrite() \u003d\u003d false` to both `canAddIgnoredField` and `markFieldAsCopyTo` methods introduces a dependency on the index settings for controlling whether ignored fields should be added. This change is consistent across multiple usages, but it\u0027s important to ensure that this setting is correctly configured and understood by users of the system. Additionally, verify that this new condition does not inadvertently skip adding ignored fields in scenarios where they are expected.","nodes":[{"id":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParserContext.java-server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParserContext.java-12292:12325-12348:12437","promptId":"#6QPQ3","srcPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParserContext.java","dstPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParserContext.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":12292,"endPos":12325,"startLine":370,"startLineOffset":12,"endLine":370,"endLineOffset":45,"length":34}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":12348,"endPos":12437,"startLine":370,"startLineOffset":12,"endLine":370,"endLineOffset":101,"length":90}]},{"id":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParserContext.java-server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParserContext.java-11263:11321-11263:11377","promptId":"#6GFDQ","srcPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParserContext.java","dstPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/DocumentParserContext.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":11263,"endPos":11321,"startLine":336,"startLineOffset":15,"endLine":336,"endLineOffset":73,"length":59}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":11263,"endPos":11377,"startLine":336,"startLineOffset":15,"endLine":336,"endLineOffset":129,"length":115}]}]},{"comment":"The removal of `IgnoredSourceFieldMapper.NAME` from `requiredStoredFields` in `Synthetic` constructor and its conditional addition in `ensureLoaded` method introduces a potential inconsistency. If `indexSettings.getSkipIgnoredSourceRead()` is true, `_ignored_source` will not be added to `requiredStoredFields`, which might lead to unexpected behavior if other parts of the code assume `_ignored_source` is always included. The `ensureLoaded` method in `IgnoredSourceFieldMapper` includes a comment that suggests it handles rare decoding failures. However, the method itself does not handle any exceptions or errors related to field loading. Ensure that this method is robust enough to handle potential issues during field loading, especially given the comment about rare decoding failures. The addition of `IgnoredSourceFieldMapper.ensureLoaded` in `syntheticFieldLoader` method enhances the control over which fields are loaded for synthetic sources. However, it introduces a dependency on `indexSettings`. Ensure that `indexSettings` is properly initialized and available at this point to avoid potential null pointer exceptions.","nodes":[{"id":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/IgnoredSourceFieldMapper.java-server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/IgnoredSourceFieldMapper.java--8024:8111,8116:8139,8144:8218,8223:8251,8256:8552,8558:10073","promptId":"#RS2WK","srcPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/IgnoredSourceFieldMapper.java","dstPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/mapper/IgnoredSourceFieldMapper.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":8024,"endPos":8111,"startLine":181,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":181,"endLineOffset":91,"length":88},{"pos":8116,"endPos":8139,"startLine":182,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":182,"endLineOffset":27,"length":24},{"pos":8144,"endPos":8218,"startLine":183,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":183,"endLineOffset":78,"length":75},{"pos":8223,"endPos":8251,"startLine":184,"startLine